{"audit_run_id":"audit:25da8830db5c439d9ed2b7d616d53564","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"`workstation_evaluation.csv` — the committed data file for the sit-stand workstation"},{"end_column":84,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"evaluation. Fixed values, held in the file; nothing in it is generated at run time."},{"end_column":87,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"One row is **one employee**. Each of the 56 desk-based claims processors who took part"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"appears exactly once, with the workstation condition they were on for the twelve weeks and"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"their value for each of the seven declared outcome variables. Measurements were taken over"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"the final working week, from the questionnaires, the chair-and-desk posture logger and the"},{"end_column":19,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"keyboard software."},{"end_column":92,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"The file has 56 data rows plus a header row, 9 columns, no missing cells and no extra rows."},{"end_column":60,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"28 employees are in each of the two workstation conditions."},{"end_column":88,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"Columns 3 through 9 are the seven declared outcome variables, in the order fixed in the"},{"end_column":21,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"evaluation protocol."},{"end_column":63,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"| # | Column | Type | Unit or scale | Range in file | Source |"},{"end_column":63,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"|---|--------|------|---------------|---------------|--------|"},{"end_column":127,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"| 1 | `employee_id` | text | `EMP` prefix plus a zero-padded two-digit serial | `EMP01` to `EMP56`, unique | employee roster |"},{"end_column":245,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"| 2 | `workstation_group` | text | workstation condition, exactly two values: `fixed_desk` (existing fixed-height desk) and `sit_stand` (height-adjustable sit-stand workstation with a short training session) | 28 rows each | allocation record |"},{"end_column":172,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"| 3 | `neck_shoulder_discomfort_0_10` | integer | neck and shoulder discomfort over the past week, 0 to 10 numeric rating scale, higher is worse | 0 to 8 | questionnaire |"},{"end_column":162,"end_line":29,"start_column":1,"start_line":29,"text":"| 4 | `lower_back_discomfort_0_10` | integer | lower-back discomfort over the past week, 0 to 10 numeric rating scale, higher is worse | 0 to 7 | questionnaire |"},{"end_column":117,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"| 5 | `sitting_time_min` | integer | sitting time during the working day, in minutes | 203 to 475 | posture logger |"},{"end_column":142,"end_line":31,"start_column":1,"start_line":31,"text":"| 6 | `sit_to_stand_changes_per_day` | integer | number of sit-to-stand posture changes per working day, a count | 3 to 25 | posture logger |"},{"end_column":122,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"| 7 | `end_of_day_fatigue_0_10` | integer | end-of-day fatigue, 0 to 10 scale, higher is worse | 1 to 8 | questionnaire |"},{"end_column":152,"end_line":33,"start_column":1,"start_line":33,"text":"| 8 | `typing_throughput_kpm` | decimal, 1 place | typing throughput in keystrokes per minute during logged work | 132.8 to 287.8 | keyboard software |"},{"end_column":151,"end_line":34,"start_column":1,"start_line":34,"text":"| 9 | `work_engagement_0_6` | decimal, 1 place | work engagement, 0 to 6 questionnaire scale, higher means more engaged | 2.1 to 5.8 | questionnaire |"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":38,"start_column":1,"start_line":38,"text":"Each value is rounded the way its instrument records it: the 0-to-10 rating scales and the"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":39,"start_column":1,"start_line":39,"text":"0-to-6 engagement scale are questionnaire responses, the discomfort and fatigue ratings as"},{"end_column":93,"end_line":40,"start_column":1,"start_line":40,"text":"whole numbers and engagement to one decimal place; sitting time is whole minutes and posture"},{"end_column":89,"end_line":41,"start_column":1,"start_line":41,"text":"changes a whole count from the logger; typing throughput is keystrokes per minute to one"},{"end_column":42,"end_line":42,"start_column":1,"start_line":42,"text":"decimal place from the keyboard software."},{"end_column":91,"end_line":46,"start_column":1,"start_line":46,"text":"- Read `workstation_group` as the grouping variable. It holds exactly two distinct values."},{"end_column":94,"end_line":47,"start_column":1,"start_line":47,"text":"- All seven outcomes are complete for every employee, so no missing-value handling is needed."},{"end_column":92,"end_line":48,"start_column":1,"start_line":48,"text":"- The two conditions overlap on every outcome. Individual employees in either condition can"},{"end_column":38,"end_line":49,"start_column":3,"start_line":49,"text":"be found across most of each scale."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:6085b70f0e0e7b317363","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:c6a527d2c6841e1e039f381a8e79f6e8fc671f20bda836b209f08a9a88764aa4","end_line":49,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-49","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:25da8830db5c439d9ed2b7d616d53564","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":111,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `workstation_group` column of `workstation_evaluation.csv`."},{"end_column":234,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: neck_shoulder_discomfort_0_10, lower_back_discomfort_0_10, sitting_time_min, sit_to_stand_changes_per_day, end_of_day_fatigue_0_10, typing_throughput_kpm, work_engagement_0_6."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:804b1af26c40c267091b","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:e981613c5463ba71f5cd6510c1a415fe1bf52987607f5a2e68d679a5027c7929","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
